ions.","Invoking `getApolloContext` in an environment where `React.createContext` is not available.\nThe Apollo Client functionality you are trying to use is only available in React Client Components.\nPlease make sure to add \"use client\" at the top of your file.\nFor more information, see https://nextjs.org/docs/getting-started/react-essentials#client-components","ApolloProvider was not passed a client instance. Make sure you pass in your client via the \"client\" prop.","Missing/invalid \"sha256\" or \"generateHash\" function. Please configure one using the \"createPersistedQueryLink(options)\" options parameter.","To initialize Apollo Client, you must specify a 'cache' property in the options object. \nFor more information, please visit: https://go.apollo.dev/c/docs","To initialize Apollo Client, you must specify a 'link' property in the options object. \nFor more information, please visit: https://go.apollo.dev/c/docs","The cache-and-network fetchPolicy does not work with client.query, because client.query can only return a single result. Please use client.watchQuery to receive multiple results from the cache and the network, or consider using a different fetchPolicy, such as cache-first or network-only.","The standby fetchPolicy does not work with client.query, because standby does not fetch. Consider using a different fetchPolicy, such as cache-first or network-only.","query option is required. You must specify your GraphQL document in the query option.","The terminating link provided to `ApolloLink.execute` called `forward` instead of handling the request. This results in an observable that immediately completes and does not emit a value. Please provide a terminating link that properly handles the request.\n\nIf you are using a split link, ensure each branch contains a terminating link that handles the request.","cache.modify: You are trying to write a Reference that is not part of the store: %o\nPlease make sure to set the `mergeIntoStore` parameter to `true` when creating a Reference that is not part of the store yet:\n`toReference(object, true)`","cache.modify: Writing an array with a mix of both References and Objects will not result in the Objects being normalized correctly.\nPlease convert the object instance %o to a Reference before writing it to the cache by calling `toReference(object, true)`.","1394","system / SharedFunctionInfo / pushHostContainer","system / SharedFunctionInfo / getOwnHostContext","system / SharedFunctionInfo / popHostContainer","system / SharedFunctionInfo / markRootFinished","system / StoreHandler","system / SharedFunctionInfo / getActiveElementDeep","system / SharedFunctionInfo / getActiveElement","system / SharedFunctionInfo / schedulePerformWorkUntilDeadline","system / SharedFunctionInfo / handleMessage","system / SharedFunctionInfo / sendMessage","system / SharedFunctionInfo / ca","system / SharedFunctionInfo / ud","system / SharedFunctionInfo / n0","system / SharedFunctionInfo / n8","system / SharedFunctionInfo / cr","system / SharedFunctionInfo / cy","system / SharedFunctionInfo / rV","system / SharedFunctionInfo / tp","system / SharedFunctionInfo / cj","system / SharedFunctionInfo / cf","system / SharedFunctionInfo / IdleDeadline","system / SharedFunctionInfo / timeRemaining","IdleDeadline (prototype) / http://localhost:3000","18975","19146","system / Script / http://localhost:3000/_next/static/chunks/node_modules_next_dist_client_0pe1dg-._.js","18990","19126","system / Script / http://localhost:3000/_next/static/chunks/node_modules_react-dom_0bruynb._.js","system / SharedFunctionInfo / testStringCoercion","system / SharedFunctionInfo / createPortal$1","system / SharedFunctionInfo / getCrossOriginStringAs","system / SharedFunctionInfo / getValueDescriptorExpectingObjectForWarning","system / SharedFunctionInfo / getValueDescriptorExpectingEnumForWarning","system / SharedFunctionInfo / resolveDispatcher","system / SharedFunctionInfo / r","system / SharedFunctionInfo / checkDCE","syst